{"unit_id":"tag:08WW:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在本小节中，始终固定环映射（ring map）<MATH_0001>。如第<REF_0001>节所述，我们可以用余单纯（cosimplicial）代数（algebras）的语言讨论模（modules）的下降（descent）数据（data），但在本小节中我们倾向于采用更具体的术语。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n对于<MATH_0002>，令<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上的<MATH_0004>重张量积（tensor product）。按公式定义环（ring）同态（homomorphisms）<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>：\n<MATH_0010>\n换言之，上指标（upper index）表示来源环（ring），下指标（lower index）表示插入因子（factors）1的位置。（此记号（notation）与第<REF_0002>节引入的记号（notation）相容。）\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n回顾<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>准确地说，这里的<MATH_0011>是定义<REF_0003>中<MATH_0012>的逆（inverse）。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>定义<REF_0004>：对于<MATH_0013>，<TEXTITOPEN_0001>下降（descent）数据（datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是<MATH_0014>上相对于<MATH_0015>的<MATH_0017>模（modules）的同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0016>\n，满足<TEXTITOPEN_0002>上闭链条件（cocycle condition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\n<MATH_0018>\n令<MATH_0019>为配备相对于<MATH_0021>的下降（descent）数据（data）的<MATH_0020>模（modules）的范畴（category）。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n例如，对于<MATH_0022>，选取同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0023>，将<MATH_0024>和<MATH_0025>自然地等同于<MATH_0026>，便得到下降（descent）数据（datum）。特别地，这一构造定义了函子（functor）<MATH_0027>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"tensor product","target_term":"张量积"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"homomorphisms","target_term":"同态"},{"source_term":"upper index","target_term":"上指标"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"lower index","target_term":"下指标"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"因子"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"d